  "html": "<div style=\"max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #111111; line-height: 1.45;\">\n<div style=\"border-top: 6px solid #c8102e; padding: 24px 0 22px 0; margin-bottom: 34px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e4e4e4;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #c8102e; margin-bottom: 6px;\">STUDIO SPECIALISM 01</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Experimental Formats</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #666666;\">Level 5 \u00b7 Year 2 \u00b7 Semester 1 \u00b7 Autumn 2026 \u00b7 40 credits</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 30px; margin-bottom: 48px;\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 500px; min-width: 300px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #c8102e; margin-bottom: 6px;\">MODULE INTRODUCTION</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">Welcome to Experimental Formats</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: #c8102e; font-size: 12px;\"><iframe class=\"lti-embed\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 278px; display: inline-block;\" title=\"EF module intro\" src=\"https://buv.instructure.com/courses/7121/external_tools/retrieve?display=borderless&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fbuv.instructuremedia.com%2Flti%2Flaunch%3Fcustom_arc_launch_type%3Dthumbnail_embed%26custom_arc_media_id%3D9695b3ef-113c-4348-8984-395dd61ed9b2-34847%26custom_arc_show_rolling_transcript%3Dtrue%26custom_arc_start_at%3D0\" width=\"480\" height=\"278\" loading=\"lazy\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" webkitallowfullscreen=\"webkitallowfullscreen\" mozallowfullscreen=\"mozallowfullscreen\" allow=\"geolocation *; microphone *; camera *; midi *; encrypted-media *; autoplay *; clipboard-write *; display-capture *; fullscreen *\" data-studio-resizable=\"true\" data-studio-tray-enabled=\"true\" data-studio-convertible-to-link=\"true\"></iframe></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: #c8102e; font-size: 12px;\">MODULE LEARNING OUTCOMES</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 420px; min-width: 300px;\">\n<div style=\"border-left: 4px solid #c8102e; background: #f8f8f8; padding: 12px 15px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #c8102e; margin-bottom: 4px;\">LO1 \u00b7 Enquiry</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Use media experimentation to address communication design problems, based on research analysis, audience criteria, or project objectives.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border-left: 4px solid #233b6e; background: #f3f5f9; padding: 12px 15px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #233b6e; margin-bottom: 4px;\">LO2 \u00b7 Knowledge &amp; Understanding</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Consider the influence of historical and cultural contexts on specialist production methods.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border-left: 4px solid #c8102e; background: #f8f8f8; padding: 12px 15px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #c8102e; margin-bottom: 4px;\">LO3 \u00b7 Problem Solving</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Generate visual ideas and outcomes in response to established themes or problems, utilising experimental approaches and production skills.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border-left: 4px solid #233b6e; background: #f3f5f9; padding: 12px 15px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #233b6e; margin-bottom: 4px;\">LO4 \u00b7 Communication</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Practice and present specialist visual communication and sequential design techniques in the creation of fictional or non-fictional outcomes.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #dddddd; padding-top: 26px; margin-bottom: 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #c8102e; margin-bottom: 6px;\">WEEKLY TIMETABLE</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 7px;\">Your Teaching Week</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #555555; max-width: 900px;\">This timetable shows your Experimental Formats sessions together with CI, so you can see how your teaching week fits together. CI is shown in grey for reference only.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 7px; margin-bottom: 30px;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #dcebfa; padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 11px; border: 1px solid #b8cde2;\"> EF \u00b7 GD </span> <span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #ddeee5; padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 11px; border: 1px solid #b7d2c3;\"> EF \u00b7 ILL </span> <span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #e8e0f7; padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 11px; border: 1px solid #c5b7dd;\"> EF \u00b7 ANI </span> <span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7efcf; padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 11px; border: 1px solid #d9ca8e;\"> EF \u00b7 Digital Class </span> <span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f8e2d8; padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 11px; border: 1px solid #ddb4a4;\"> EF \u00b7 Common Lecture </span> <span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #eeeeee; color: #777777; padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 11px; border: 1px solid #d0d0d0;\"> CI&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #c8102e; margin-bottom: 5px;\">W1 \u00b7 W2 \u00b7 W4 \u00b7 W6 \u00b7 W7</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 23px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">Common Lecture Weeks</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #666666;\">GD, ILL and ANI come together for one EF Common Lecture on Tuesday, 12:00\u20132:00 PM.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"overflow-x: auto; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n<div style=\"min-width: 1170px; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #dddddd;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; background: #f7f7f7; border-bottom: 1px solid #dddddd;\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1 0 210px; text-align: center; padding: 13px 6px; border-right: 1px solid